## Description

Today, we’re launching Prodigy Research (YC S26), the frontier AI trading research lab. We’re training the world’s best foundation model for quantitative finance.  Our AI quant outperforms a top 10% trader at Jane Street, and we've already achieved more than 100% returns in live https://t.co/gB7EE7hE0e

