## Transcript

[00:00:00] We're Prodigy, an AI trading research lab.
[00:00:02] We've built the world's best foundation model for quantitative finance.
[00:00:06] We're already trading live in the financial markets,
[00:00:09] and we've more than doubled our money in the last two months,
[00:00:12] while the S&P 500 was flat.
[00:00:14] I'm Michael. I spent years on a Jane Street trading desk,
[00:00:17] where I built strategies that generated billions in P&L.
[00:00:20] After that, I was a researcher at Google DeepMind,
[00:00:23] where I trained foundation models to achieve state-of-the-art performance
[00:00:25] in reasoning, coding, and long-horizon agentic tasks.
[00:00:28] I'm Yuhua. I built cutting-edge AI at Apple,
[00:00:32] running on tens of thousands of GPUs
[00:00:34] and serving billions of user requests every day.
[00:00:37] We've trained a model that beats Claude Fable and GPT-5.6 Sol
[00:00:40] at financial benchmarks and quantitative research tasks.
[00:00:43] In real-world trading, our model is better than a 90th percentile Jane Street trader.
[00:00:48] Our strategies are delta-neutral,
[00:00:50] and thanks to our rigorous and comprehensive risk controls,
[00:00:53] we've never had a down week.
[00:00:55] Join us as we use AI to solve the market.

